        "geoBoundaries-ARG-ADM2-simplified"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Georef comparator has six exact-name matches in Buenos Aires, but this name-only relationship does not establish geometry equality, layer vintage, reuse permission, or legal boundary authority.",
